---
import Layout from "../../../layouts/LearningGardenLayout.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import assemblyPrayer from "../../../assets/photos/shared/assembly-prayer-01.jpg";
import campusEntrance from "../../../assets/photos/shared/campus-entrance-01.jpg";
---

<Layout
  title="About the School — The Learning Garden — Green Valley Matriculation School"
  description="How Green Valley Matriculation School began, what it believes, and a message from the Principal."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">The Story</p>
    <h1>How a school becomes a garden.</h1>
    <p class="hero-lede">
      Green Valley Matriculation School is a Kindergarten–Class 10 school in Nagercoil, Tamil Nadu.
      This is the short version of how it began, and what it still believes.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="story-image">
    <Image src={assemblyPrayer} alt="Students standing together for morning assembly and prayer" width={1800} height={800} />
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <p class="eyebrow">Our Beginning</p>
    <h2>A school planted on purpose.</h2>
    <p>
      Green Valley Matriculation School was founded with a simple aim: to give children in and
      around Nagercoil a place to learn that felt as unhurried and alive as the land around it.
      <em>(Placeholder history — founding year, founders, and early milestones to be confirmed
      with the school.)</em>
    </p>
    <p>
      Over the years, the campus has grown the way a garden grows — one classroom, one
      laboratory, one shaded walkway at a time — always in service of the same idea: children
      learn best when they are known, and given room to grow at their own pace.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <p class="eyebrow">Vision &amp; Mission</p>
    <h2>What we're working toward.</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>Vision.</strong> A school where every child leaves with strong foundations,
      confident character, and a lifelong love of learning.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Mission.</strong> To teach with curiosity and care, to treat discipline and
      kindness as partners, and to keep the campus itself — its gardens, light, and quiet
      corners — part of how children learn.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section principal-section" id="principal">
    <p class="eyebrow">Leadership</p>
    <h2>A message from the Principal.</h2>
    <div class="principal-card">
      <span class="quote-mark" aria-hidden="true">“</span>
      <blockquote>
        Every child who walks through our gates brings something worth growing — our work is
        simply to give it light, room, and good soil. We ask our teachers to know each student
        by name, and we ask our students to be curious before they are certain.
      </blockquote>
      <p class="principal-attribution">
        — Mrs. Lakshmi Narayanan, Principal <em>(placeholder name)</em>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="campus-glimpse content-wide">
    <div class="glimpse-grid">
      <div class="glimpse-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">The Campus</p>
        <h2>A garden the school grows around.</h2>
        <p>
          Shaded walkways, a working school garden, and open play areas sit alongside our
          classrooms and labs — part of the campus, not just a backdrop to it.
        </p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/learning-garden/campus/">Walk the campus →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="glimpse-image">
        <Image src={campusEntrance} alt="Tree-lined school entrance gate" width={900} height={700} />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .story-image { max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto 4rem; padding: 0 1.5rem; }
  .story-image > :global(img) { border-radius: 28px; height: 360px; object-fit: cover; width: 100%; }

  .principal-card {
    background: var(--white);
    border-radius: 28px;
    padding: 2.5rem;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 50px -25px rgba(30, 58, 41, 0.3);
    position: relative;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }
  .quote-mark {
    font-family: "Fraunces", serif;
    font-size: 3.5rem;
    color: var(--leaf-200);
    display: block;
    line-height: 0.5;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .principal-card blockquote {
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
    font-family: "Fraunces", serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--forest-900);
  }
  .principal-attribution { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--ink-soft); margin: 0; }

  .campus-glimpse { margin-bottom: 5rem; }
  .glimpse-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 3rem; align-items: center; }
  .glimpse-image :global(img) { border-radius: 24px; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 4/3.2; object-fit: cover; }
  .glimpse-copy h2 { font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.6vw, 2rem); }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .glimpse-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .glimpse-image { order: -1; }
  }
</style>
